  "description": "Pink Christmas Watercolor Clipart is a sweet and whimsical holiday collection filled with charming Christmas characters, festive decorations and cozy seasonal elements in a beautiful pastel pink and mint color palette.\nThis adorable watercolor collection includes 230 Christmas illustrations featuring Santa Claus, elves, snowmen, reindeer, gingerbread characters, nutcrackers, Christmas trees, fireplaces, wreaths, stockings, candy canes, ornaments, presents, sleighs, bells, bows, candles, gingerbread houses and many other festive details.\nThe soft watercolor textures, pastel colors and cute storybook-inspired characters make this collection perfect for creating cheerful and feminine Christmas projects. The combination of blush pink, mint green, soft red and creamy winter tones gives the artwork a cozy and magical holiday feel.\nThis is a Digital Instant Download.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED:\n– 230 Christmas clipart designs\n– PNG files\n– JPG files\n– Individual digital illustrations\n– Watercolor artwork\n– Pink and mint Christmas color palette\nPERFECT FOR:\n– Christmas cards\n– holiday invitations\n– gift tags\n– stickers\n– sublimation projects\n– mugs and tumblers\n– T-shirt designs\n– printable decorations\n– scrapbooking\n– junk journals\n– planners\n– greeting cards\n– festive stationery\n– Christmas party decorations\n– nursery decor\n– holiday posters\n– digital scrapbooking\n– social media graphics\n– DIY Christmas crafts\n– seasonal printable projects\nABOUT THE STYLE:\nThis collection features a cute whimsical watercolor style with soft pastel colors and charming storybook details. Pink Christmas decorations are paired with mint green accents, cozy winter textures and playful festive characters. Santa, elves, snowmen, reindeer and classic Christmas elements create a cheerful holiday collection that works beautifully for both children’s projects and elegant pastel Christmas designs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Pink Christmas Watercolor Clipart is a sweet and whimsical holiday collection filled with charming Christmas characters, festive decorations and cozy seasonal elements in a beautiful pastel pink and mint color palette.</p>\n<p>This adorable watercolor collection includes 230 Christmas illustrations featuring Santa Claus, elves, snowmen, reindeer, gingerbread characters, nutcrackers, Christmas trees, fireplaces, wreaths, stockings, candy canes, ornaments, presents, sleighs, bells, bows, candles, gingerbread houses and many other festive details.</p>\n<p>The soft watercolor textures, pastel colors and cute storybook-inspired characters make this collection perfect for creating cheerful and feminine Christmas projects. The combination of blush pink, mint green, soft red and creamy winter tones gives the artwork a cozy and magical holiday feel.</p>\n<p>This is a Digital Instant Download.</p>\n<p>WHAT’S INCLUDED:<br>\n– 230 Christmas clipart designs<br>\n– PNG files<br>\n– JPG files<br>\n– Individual digital illustrations<br>\n– Watercolor artwork<br>\n– Pink and mint Christmas color palette</p>\n<p>PERFECT FOR:<br>\n– Christmas cards<br>\n– holiday invitations<br>\n– gift tags<br>\n– stickers<br>\n– sublimation projects<br>\n– mugs and tumblers<br>\n– T-shirt designs<br>\n– printable decorations<br>\n– scrapbooking<br>\n– junk journals<br>\n– planners<br>\n– greeting cards<br>\n– festive stationery<br>\n– Christmas party decorations<br>\n– nursery decor<br>\n– holiday posters<br>\n– digital scrapbooking<br>\n– social media graphics<br>\n– DIY Christmas crafts<br>\n– seasonal printable projects</p>\n<p>ABOUT THE STYLE:<br>\nThis collection features a cute whimsical watercolor style with soft pastel colors and charming storybook details. Pink Christmas decorations are paired with mint green accents, cozy winter textures and playful festive characters. Santa, elves, snowmen, reindeer and classic Christmas elements create a cheerful holiday collection that works beautifully for both children’s projects and elegant pastel Christmas designs.</p>",
